  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Thinly slice the onion. Trim the beans, then halve on an angle. Halve the tomatoes. Reserve a few whole leaves, then finely chop the parsley, including the stems. Drain and rinse the lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/220632/photos/large/prep_ingredients-ca8f3e05a5d9cb2640c14e202ed18819.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Marinate onion: Bring a small saucepan of water to the boil for the beans. Put the onion, 1 tbs red wine vinegar and 2 tsp honey in a large bowl. Season with salt and pepper and stir to combine. Set aside to marinate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/220633/photos/large/marinate_onion-705c88d15d974bf6bd55e0c02fbe8ac4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook beans: Cook the beans in the pan of boiling water for 2-3 mins until tender. Drain and rinse under cold water. Meanwhile, put the walnuts in a cold small frypan over medium heat. Toast, tossing, for 3-4 mins until evenly golden. Remove from the pan and cool slightly, then coarsely chop.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/220634/photos/large/cook_beans-110731ce8cdd6f2d242232271a1e89f1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss salad: Add the lentils, beans, tomatoes, chopped parsley and 1 tbs olive oil to the onion mixture and toss to combine. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/220635/photos/large/toss_salad-16b5f357ff72689aa29606a6f5797b46.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the salad among bowls. Scatter over the walnuts and parsley leaves, then crumble over the feta and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/220636/photos/large/serve_up-b10384db7f25600d716362e16d46c69a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Extra fresh herbs are a delicious addition to this salad. If you have some mint or basil from the garden, finely chop the leaves and stir through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/220637/photos/large/make_it_yours-2a9a75e67239765cce26e8487ff00f6e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
